   "量子计算与经典计算的本质区别在于信息处理方式：经典计算以比特为信息单位，只能处于0或1，而量子计算以量子比特（qubit）为基本单位，可同时处于叠加态，并通过量子叠加和纠缠实现并行处理，从而在某些特定任务上实现指数级加速。",
   "```python\nfrom functools import lru_cache\n\n@lru_cache(maxsize=None)\ndef fib(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Return the n-th Fibonacci number (0-based indexing).\n\n    Parameters\n    ----------\n    n : int\n        Index of the Fibonacci number to compute (must be non-negative).\n\n    Returns\n    -------\n    int\n        The n-th Fibonacci number.\n\n    Raises\n    ------\n    ValueError\n        If n is negative.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be a non-negative integer\")\n    if n < 2:          # Base cases: F(0) = 0, F(1) = 1\n        return n\n    return fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2)\n\n\n# Quick sanity checks\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    for i in range(10):\n        print(f\"F({i}) = {fib(i)}\")\n```",
   "To find the **average speed** for the whole trip, we use the formula:\n\n\\[\n\\text{Average speed} = \\frac{\\text{Total distance}}{\\text{Total time}}\n\\]\n\n---\n\n### **Step 1: Total Distance**\n- First part: 120 km  \n- Second part: 80 km  \n\\[\n\\text{Total distance} = 120 + 80 = 200 \\text{ km}\n\\]\n\n---\n\n### **Step 2: Total Time**\n- First part: 1.5 hours  \n- Second part: 45 minutes = 0.75 hours  \n\\[\n\\text{Total time} = 1.5 + 0.75 = 2.25 \\text{ hours}\n\\]\n\n---\n\n### **Step 3: Average Speed**\n\\[\n\\text{Average speed} = \\frac{200}{2.25} \\approx 88.89 \\text{ km/h}\n\\]\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Final Answer:\n\\[\n\\boxed{88.89 \\text{ km/h}}\n\\]",
