   "1. 使用有意义的变量名：有意义的变量名能让代码自解释，减少注释需求。  \n2. 保持函数短小精悍：短函数更容易理解和维护。  \n3. 统一代码风格：统一风格提升整体一致性。  \n4. 添加清晰注释：注释帮助理解复杂逻辑。  \n5. 模块化设计：模块化提升可维护性。",
   "Imagine you’re sending a birthday card to a friend.  \nYou have two ways to mail it:\n\n1. **TCP** is like sending a birthday card through the U.S. Postal Service.  \n   - You pay for a tracking number. The post office keeps a record of every step: “mailed, in transit, delivered, signed for.”  \n   - If the card gets lost, you can look up the tracking and know exactly where it is.  \n   - If it never arrives, you can trace it and know it was never delivered.  \n   - You can resend it or file a claim.  \n   - It’s reliable, but it costs a little more and takes a little longer.\n\n**UDP** is like sending a postcard.  \n- You write the message, slap a stamp on it, and drop it in the mailbox.  \n- You have no idea if it ever arrives.  \n- It’s cheap, fast, and you can send a lot of postcards at once.  \n- If it never arrives, you have no idea where it went.  \n- It’s cheap and fast, but you can’t check up on it.\n\nSo TCP is like sending a birthday card with tracking and a return receipt—reliable, traceable,",
